    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>&quot;Unknown Host&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game with a linear narrative and an average playtime of 30-40 minutes to complete.</i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Story</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We step into the shoes of Alex, a student who, in search of more comfort, rents an apartment in the city that, at first glance, seems pretty decent \u2014 but upon arrival, he realizes something is not right.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mystery-laden atmosphere.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647480/extras/d9d37a7715393b112b56aafa0acd8694.poster.avif?t=1746814243\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647480/extras/d9d37a7715393b112b56aafa0acd8694.webm?t=1746814243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647480/extras/d9d37a7715393b112b56aafa0acd8694.mp4?t=1746814243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Game Features</strong></i></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore various locations </strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Engage in psychological tension </strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Minimalistic gameplay mechanics</strong></i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>&quot;Unknown Host&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game with a linear narrative and an average playtime of 30-40 minutes to complete.</i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Story</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We step into the shoes of Alex, a student who, in search of more comfort, rents an apartment in the city that, at first glance, seems pretty decent \u2014 but upon arrival, he realizes something is not right.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mystery-laden atmosphere.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647480/extras/d9d37a7715393b112b56aafa0acd8694.poster.avif?t=1746814243\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647480/extras/d9d37a7715393b112b56aafa0acd8694.webm?t=1746814243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647480/extras/d9d37a7715393b112b56aafa0acd8694.mp4?t=1746814243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Game Features</strong></i></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore various locations </strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Engage in psychological tension </strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Minimalistic gameplay mechanics</strong></i></p></li></ul>",
